<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Capital started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Orion Capital started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Orion Capital Corp with an outperform rating with a mid-year 1998 price target of $88 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The shares were up 1-1/8 to 74-1/4.</p>
</text>
